# weDiet Track Diet v2 — locked decisions

When changing Track your Diet / fuel estimate / fuel meals, treat **`docs/SPEC-WEDIET-TRACK-DIET-V2.md`** as the source of truth. Do not reopen D1–D9 / F1–F9 without an explicit product change.

## Must follow

- **Multi-item meal**: slot (+ optional custom name) → items list → photo/upload/manual → item confirm → review → batch save.
- **Persist**: N `fuel_meals` rows sharing `meal_group_id` + `meal_title`; save via **`POST /api/fuel/meals/batch`** (atomic).
- **Estimate**: extend **`POST /api/fuel/estimate`** — photo optional; weight-only requires **name + weightGrams**; both paths return **macros** (protein/carbs/fat/fiber); keep `no_food` / Retake.
- **Model**: `GEMINI_FUEL_MODEL` prefer `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`; optional `GEMINI_FUEL_FALLBACK_MODEL` only (no hardcoded dead models). Flag still exact `FUEL_ESTIMATION_ENABLED=true`. Member UI: never show model IDs; `model_unavailable` uses soft studio-hint copy.
- **Autocomplete**: personal meal history first → `data/nutrition/fuel-food-catalog-v1.json` catalog; logging feeds history.
- **Slots**: prefer admin `fuelMealPlan`; else B/L/S/D; custom name always.
- **UI lists**: group row (custom title wins) → expand items; delete **group** and **item**.
- **Drafts**: localStorage, clear at member-local EOD; soft note: *“We’ll keep a draft on this device while you build this meal. It clears on its own at the end of the day.”*
- **HEIC**: reject with reason copy (no convert this ship).
- **Non-goals**: full clinical Gemini dossier UI; meal-total override; server drafts v1; photos persisted.

